{"title":"ML Engineer Roadmap","role":"ML Engineer","summary":"An ML Engineer designs, develops, evaluates, deploys, and maintains machine-learning systems that solve real-world problems.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"CSE – Artificial Intelligence & Data Science (AI&DS)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An ML Engineer designs, develops, evaluates, deploys, and maintains machine-learning systems that solve real-world problems."},{"type":"p","text":"Unlike a role focused mainly on experimentation and model research, an ML Engineer combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Software engineering"},{"text":"Data engineering"},{"text":"Model deployment"},{"text":"Cloud infrastructure"},{"text":"MLOps"},{"text":"System design"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Preparing training data"},{"text":"Developing ML models"},{"text":"Feature engineering"},{"text":"Model evaluation"},{"text":"Model optimization"},{"text":"Building inference pipelines"},{"text":"Deploying models"},{"text":"Monitoring model performance"},{"text":"Automating retraining"},{"text":"Managing ML infrastructure"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The core workflow is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business / Technical Problem","Data Collection","Data Preparation","Feature Engineering","Model Development","Evaluation","Deployment","Monitoring","Retraining / Improvement"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career Stage","Possible Roles","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry Level"},{"text":"ML Engineer, ML Engineer Trainee, Junior ML Engineer"},{"text":"Models + pipelines"}],[{"text":"2–4 Years"},{"text":"ML Engineer, Applied ML Engineer"},{"text":"Production ML"}],[{"text":"4–7 Years"},{"text":"Senior ML Engineer, ML Platform Engine